    description: "WHAT. `hypergumbo dead-code-maybe --input <map>` without a path argument reads the CURRENT directory's tree for the cross-language demotion scan. The same git-gui map gave 10 demotions from one cwd and 4 from another; run from /tmp it scanned /tmp for about 22 CPU-minutes.\n\nASK. Take the tree from the map's own recorded root, or refuse --input without a path. Found during PR 1 of the stable-id plan, 2026-11-15 (PR #2198). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr1/STATUS.md."  # e5d7
